    container_pre_start_input_constraint_copy_v1}
use std.common.contracts.container.pre_start_constraint_v1.ContainerPreStartConstraintV1
# Windows deployment-backed local Host owner. Capacity remains the existing
# journal/ledger; the service incarnation is never represented as a Linux boot.
